      "title": {
        "en": "Wino"
      },
      "body": {
        "en": "Wine (*wino*, neuter) is *białe* or *czerwone*, and *wytrawne* (dry) or *słodkie* (sweet). The day goes *rano* (in the morning), *po południu* (in the afternoon), *wieczorem* (in the evening)."
      }
